                                    </li>
                                    <li>
                                        <i class="icon icon-sport252"></i>ROLLOVER
                                        <span class="txt-org"> 1x</span>
                                    </li>
                                    
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </article>
        </div>
        <div class="promotions-module">
             <span class="promotions-title">Term & conditions apply</span>
            <article>
                <ol type="i">
                    <li>10% Free bets for all New member only when you make your 1st deposit with us</li>
                    <li>Click “JOIN NOW” to enjoy the promotion immediately.</li>
                    <li>A Free bets up to MYR 500 based on the First Deposit amount will be credited to qualified players within 48 hours</li>
                    <li>Your Deposit plus the Free bets claimed is subjected to 1 time rollover in all of Nova88 product except Casino, Live Casino,Virtual Games, Poker, Fishing Games, Chess Games and Cash Out.</li>
