                    <li>Promotion Period: 12:01PM on 05.03.2020 to 11:59AM on 1st April 2020 (GMT+8)</li>
                    <li>NOVA88 reserves the right to cancel this promotion at any time, either for all players or individual player
                        <br>and its subjected to NOVA88 Standard Terms and Conditions</li>

                    
                </ol>
            </article>
            <div class="panel panel-primary panel--payment" data-open="true">
                <div class="panel__header">
                    <span class="txt-blue">3 Easy step</span>
                    <i class="icon icon-caret"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="panel__body">

                    <p>Step 1 : Register your account on NOVA88</p>
                    <p>Step 2 : Make your 1st deposit</p>
                    <p>Step 3 : Contact Live chat and show the screenshot</p>

                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>